---

<BaseLayout
  title="Global Sangha Reach & Observability Intelligence | Jonang Monastery"
  description="Transparent, privacy-preserving telemetry and real-user performance data for Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling: international readership, Tibetan font health, and Core Web Vitals."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", path: "/" },
    { name: "Sangha Reach & Intelligence", path: STATIC_PAGE_PATHS.intelligence },
  ]}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-1">
    <!-- Sanctuary Hero Section -->
    <section
      class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-maroon-light via-maroon to-maroon-dark text-white border-b border-accent/50 pt-[calc(var(--header-h)+2rem)] sm:pt-[calc(var(--header-h)+2.5rem)] lg:pt-[calc(var(--header-h)+3.5rem)] pb-12 sm:pb-16"
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-40 right-1/4 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-gold/15 blur-[160px] mix-blend-screen rounded-full"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 relative z-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-4xl">
          <!-- Tibetan Consecrated Title -->
          <div
            lang="bo"
            class="font-tibetan text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-gold font-bold pt-1 leading-[1.6] drop-shadow-md"
          >
            ཇོ་ནང་དྲ་གནས་ཀྱི་གནས་སྡུད།
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h1
              class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15] m-0 drop-shadow-md"
            >
              Global Sangha Reach & Telemetry Intelligence
            </h1>

            <p class="font-serif text-base sm:text-lg text-white/90 leading-relaxed m-0 pt-1">
              Transparent, privacy-first telemetry tracking how the teachings, sacred scripture, and
              monastic curriculum of <strong>Jonang Takten Phuntsok Choeling</strong> are received across
              the worldwide Buddhist diaspora.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Privacy & Ethics Declaration Card -->
          <div
            class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-maroon/85 border border-gold/30 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-2"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span
                class="flex h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 ring-4 ring-emerald-400/25 animate-pulse"
              ></span>
              <div class="flex flex-col">
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold">
                  Privacy-First Monastic Telemetry
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs text-white/80 font-serif">
                  Daily-rotating salted SHA-256 visitor hashing · Zero cookies · Zero personal
                  tracking · GDPR & CCPA compliant
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-white/70 shrink-0">
              <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 border border-white/20"
                >Live Pipeline</span
              >
              <span>Axiom Cloud</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Analytics Body Container -->
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-16">
      <!-- Executive KPI Cards -->
      <section aria-label="Executive Indicators">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
          <div
            class="surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card flex flex-col gap-1.5"
          >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >Total Ingested Beacons</span
            >
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-accent"
              >{telemetryMeta.totalEvents.toLocaleString()}</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted"
              >{telemetryMeta.eventsPerVisitor} beacons per visitor</span
            >
          </div>

          <div
            class="surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card flex flex-col gap-1.5"
          >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >Unique Practitioners</span
            >
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-accent-secondary"
              >{telemetryMeta.uniqueVisitors.toLocaleString()}</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted">Salted daily SHA-256 hashes</span>
          </div>

          <div
            class="surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card flex flex-col gap-1.5"
          >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >Deep Reading Sessions</span
            >
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-ink"
              >{telemetryMeta.uniqueSessions.toLocaleString()}</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted"
              >{telemetryMeta.eventsPerSession} events per session</span
            >
          </div>

          <div
            class="surface-card p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card flex flex-col gap-1.5"
          >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >Global Reach</span
            >
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-accent-tertiary"
              >{telemetryMeta.uniqueCountries} Nations</span
            >
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted">Across 5 continents</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Chapter 01: Geographic Distribution & Diaspora Reach -->
      <section class="space-y-8" id="geographic-reach">
        <ChapterHeader
          chapter="Chapter 01"
          title="Geographic Intelligence & Worldwide Sangha"
          tibetanTitle="རྒྱལ་སྤྱིའི་དད་ལྡན་ཚོགས་པའི་ཁྱབ་ཁོངས།"
          lede="The Jonang tradition holds profound historical bonds across the Himalayan plateau, Mongolia, and the Russian Buddhist republics of Kalmykia and Buryatia, alongside an expanding modern sangha in the West."
        />

        <!-- Country Distribution Matrix -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
          <!-- Left: Top Countries Visual Bars -->
          <div
            class="lg:col-span-7 surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card space-y-4"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border pb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
                >Sovereign Nation</span
              >
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
                >Views / Readership Share</span
              >
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
              {
                topCountries.map((c) => (
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans">
                      <span class="font-medium text-ink flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="text-base">{c.flag}</span>
                        <span>{c.name}</span>
                      </span>
                      <span class="font-mono text-muted">
                        <strong class="text-ink font-bold">{c.views}</strong> views ({c.pct}%)
                      </span>
                    </div>
                    {/* Progress Bar */}
                    <div class="w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-surface-subtle overflow-hidden">
                      <div
                        class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-accent-secondary rounded-full transition-all duration-500"
                        style={`width: ${Math.max(3, c.pct * 2.2)}%;`}
                      />
                    </div>
                  </div>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right: Metropolitan Centers & Lineage Relevance -->
          <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6">
            <div
              class="surface-card p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card space-y-4 flex-1"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-display text-ink font-bold m-0 border-b border-border pb-2.5">
                Top Metropolitan Reading Hubs
              </h3>
              <ul class="m-0 p-0 list-none flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans">
                {
                  topCities.slice(0, 10).map((city) => (
                    <li class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/50 pb-2">
                      <span class="text-ink font-medium">
                        {city.city}, <span class="text-muted text-xs">{city.country}</span>
                      </span>
                      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold">
                        {city.views} views ({city.visitors} vis)
                      </span>
                    </li>
                  ))
                }
              </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Historical Note on Mongolia & Kalmykia -->
            <div
              class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-ink space-y-2"
            >
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-accent font-bold text-sm">❖</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
                  Historical Lineage Heritage
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-serif text-muted leading-relaxed m-0">
                The presence of readers in <strong>Ulaanbaatar (57 views)</strong> and <strong
                  >Russia (159 views)</strong
                > reflects the enduring spiritual imprint of <em>Jetsun Tāranātha</em> and the First Bogd
                Gegeen <em>Zanabazar</em>, through whom Jonang Kalachakra transmissions were woven
                into the spiritual history of Mongolia, Buryatia, and Kalmykia.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Chapter 02: Canonical Doctrinal Journey -->
      <section class="space-y-8" id="doctrinal-routes">
        <ChapterHeader
          chapter="Chapter 02"
          title="Canonical Content Engagement & Route Distribution"
          tibetanTitle="གཞུང་ལུགས་བལྟ་ཀློག་གི་གནས་བབ།"
          lede="Reader interest focuses extensively on the monastery sanctuary grounds, the Shentong philosophical treatises, the living lineages of masters, and the Kālacakra Tantra."
        />

        <div
          class="surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card overflow-x-auto"
        >
          <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm font-sans border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr
                class="border-b border-border text-muted font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]"
              >
                <th class="py-3 px-3">Canonical Route</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-3">Page Focus & Doctrinal Content</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-3 text-right">Pageviews</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-3 text-right">Unique Readers</th>
                <th class="py-3 px-3 text-right">Traffic Share</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-border/60">
              {
                topRoutes.map((r) => (
                  <tr class="hover:bg-surface-subtle/60 transition-colors">
                    <td class="py-3 px-3 font-mono font-bold text-accent">
                      <a href={r.path} class="hover:underline hover:text-gold">
                        {r.path}
                      </a>
                    </td>
                    <td class="py-3 px-3 font-serif text-ink">{r.title}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 px-3 font-mono text-right text-ink font-bold">{r.views}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 px-3 font-mono text-right text-muted">{r.visitors}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 px-3 font-mono text-right text-accent-secondary font-bold">
                      {r.pct}%
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))
              }
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Chapter 03: Tibetan Font Health & Cultural Script Integrity -->
      <section class="space-y-8" id="tibetan-font-health">
        <ChapterHeader
          chapter="Chapter 03"
          title="Sacred Script & Tibetan Typography Health"
          tibetanTitle="བོད་ཡིག་ཡིག་གཟུགས་ཀྱི་དྲ་རྒྱའི་བདེ་ཐང་།"
          lede="Rigorous automated client-side font audits measure whether browsers successfully download and render classical Tibetan typefaces or degrade into system fallbacks."
        />

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8">
          <div
            class="lg:col-span-5 surface-card p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-border shadow-card space-y-6"
          >
            <h3 class="text-xl font-display text-ink font-bold m-0 border-b border-border pb-3">
              Client Rendering Audit Summary
            </h3>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div
                class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex flex-col gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 font-bold"
                  >Status OK</span
                >
                <span class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400"
                  >{fontAudit.ok}</span
                >
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted"
                  >{fontAudit.okPct} of verified sessions</span
                >
              </div>

              <div
                class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 flex flex-col gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-800 dark:text-rose-300 font-bold"
                  >Status Degraded</span
                >
                <span class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400"
                  >{fontAudit.degraded}</span
                >
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-muted"
                  >{fontAudit.degradedPct} font timeout fallbacks</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-serif text-muted leading-relaxed space-y-3 pt-2">
              <p class="m-0">
                <strong>Why font health matters:</strong> Classical Jonang pecha verses and tantric root
                texts require ligatures, vowel sub-joining, and proper vertical metrics. If web fonts
                fail, standard OS fallback fonts often distort stacked characters.
              </p>
              <p class="m-0">
